---
import BaseLayout from "@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---
<BaseLayout title="Backstory" description="The backstory of Gustavo Barretto.">
  <h1 class="section-heading">Backstory</h1>
  <div class="backstory-layout">
    <img src="/avatar.jpg" alt="Gustavo Barretto" width="144" height="176" class="backstory-photo" />
    <div class="editorial-copy article-body">
      <p>I like to build things, especially those that make a difference.</p>
      <p>
        Currently Software Engineer at <a href="https://x.com/mercadolibre" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">@mercadolibre</a>, Latin America’s largest e-commerce with over 200 million users and more than 5,000 microservices integrated on the Fury platform—where I work, mainly providing IaC (Infrastructure as Code) in a custom IDP (Internal Developer Platform) for Mercado Libre developers.
      </p>
      <p>
        I’ve been a professor of Political Science and Constitutional Law, I’ve studied Economics, and I’m a Law graduate, as well as a Computer Science graduate—always wanting to make a difference wherever I go.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
